### GET tous les ingrédients
GET http://localhost:8080/ingredients
Accept: application/json

### GET ingrédient par id
GET http://localhost:8080/ingredients/1
Accept: application/json

### GET ingrédient introuvable → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/ingredients/99
Accept: application/json

### GET stock d'un ingrédient
GET http://localhost:8080/ingredients/1/stock?at=2024-01-06T12:00:00&unit=KG
Accept: application/json

### GET stock sans paramètres → 400
GET http://localhost:8080/ingredients/1/stock
Accept: application/json

### GET tous les plats
GET http://localhost:8080/dishes
Accept: application/json

### PUT modifier les ingrédients d'un plat
PUT http://localhost:8080/dishes/1/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Laitue",
    "price": 800.00,
    "category": "VEGETABLE",
    "quantityRequired": 0.20,
    "unit": "KG"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "name": "Tomate",
    "price": 600.00,
    "category": "VEGETABLE",
    "quantityRequired": 0.15,
    "unit": "KG"
  }
]

### PUT avec corps vide → 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/dishes/1/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### PUT plat introuvable → 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/dishes/999/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Laitue",
    "price": 800.00,
    "category": "VEGETABLE",
    "quantityRequired": 0.20,
    "unit": "KG"
  }
]


### GET mouvements de stock filtrés par date
GET http://localhost:8080/ingredients/1/stockMovements?from=2024-01-05T00:00:00&to=2024-01-06T23:59:59
Accept: application/json

### GET mouvements — ingrédient introuvable → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/ingredients/999/stockMovements?from=2024-01-05T00:00:00&to=2024-01-06T23:59:59
Accept: application/json

### POST ajouter des mouvements de stock
POST http://localhost:8080/ingredients/1/stockMovements
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"unit": "KG", "value": 3.0, "type": "IN"},
  {"unit": "KG", "value": 1.5, "type": "OUT"}
]

### POST — ingrédient introuvable → 404
POST http://localhost:8080/ingredients/999/stockMovements
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"unit": "KG", "value": 3.0, "type": "IN"}
]